Third-party components:

The Rust crates built into the program are listed, each with its license, in THIRD-PARTY.md
(generated by `cargo run -p prismqda-licensecheck -- --write-third-party`). Anything else adopted
(models, word lists, fonts, other data files) is recorded here with its attribution when it is added.

SQLite (https://www.sqlite.org) is built into the program through the rusqlite and libsqlite3-sys
crates. SQLite's source code is in the public domain.

The prism logo, the application icon, and the interface icons (assets/brand and assets/icons) are original vector
drawings created for PrismQDA with an AI image tool, and are released under the same license as the project, the Apache License
2.0. The letters of the wordmark in
assets/brand/brand-logo.svg and brand-logo-light.svg are outlines taken from the Inter and Inter Display typefaces
(Copyright 2016-2023 The Inter Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1). The pack's provenance notes are in
design/icons/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.

The interface text is set in Inter Variable (Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1),
bundled as two WOFF2 files in app/ui/src/assets/fonts, taken unchanged from the @fontsource-variable/inter 5.3.0 package.
The license text is in app/ui/src/assets/fonts/Inter-OFL.txt, and the installer places a copy (Inter-OFL.txt) beside this
notice.

